5496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Chanterelles are incredibly beautiful choice wild mushrooms that may be purchased in a specialty market, however, it is becoming increasingly more common for people to hunt for their own wild mushrooms like we do!<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nChanterelle Chowder is a fabulous way to use these tasty mushrooms. They add great flavor to the creamy sauce and interestingly take on a similar look and texture to clams when prepared in this way, enhanced with a small amount of clam broth.&nbsp;</span></h5>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-kwmluvca":{"label":"Jump to Recipe","skin":"ShinyButtonISkin","link":{"href":"https://www.theglasspantry.com/chanterelle-chowder#chanterellechowder","target":"_self","anchorCompId":"comp-kwmluvdr","pageId":{"type":"Page","id":"i00wb","metaData":{"isPreset":false,"schemaVersion":"2.0","isHidden":false,"sig":"7ku-6617"},"title":"Chanterelle Chowder","hideTitle":true,"icon":"","descriptionSEO":"Chanterelle Chowder | Chanterelle Mushroom Recipe | Wild Mushroom Recipe | Cooking Wild Mushrooms | The Glass Pantry A Food Adventure | Melisa Smith","metaKeywordsSEO":"","pageTitleSEO":"Chanterelle Chowder","pageUriSEO":"chanterelle-chowder","hidePage":true,"isMobileLandingPage":false,"underConstruction":false,"tpaApplicationId":0,"pageSecurity":{"requireLogin":false,"passwordDigest":"","dialogLanguage":""},"isPopup":false,"indexable":true,"isLandingPage":false,"pageBackgrounds":{"desktop":{"custom":true,"ref":{"type":"BackgroundMedia","id":"i00wb_desktop_bg","metaData":{"isPreset":false,"schemaVersion":"2.0","isHidden":false,"sig":"7ms-244"},"color":"#FFFFFF","alignType":"center","fittingType":"fill","scrollType":"scroll","colorOverlay":"","colorOverlayOpacity":0},"isPreset":true},"mobile":{"custom":true,"ref":{"type":"BackgroundMedia","id":"i00wb_mobile_bg","metaData":{"isPreset":